--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a4fafe43b89343e3a7ba1235e8987c0f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 5. IvesExplanation
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Entries:
  - content: "Hah! Thought you might be itching for an explanation eh? You see\u2026"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 3264111934402461759
    - rid: 3264111934402461760
    - rid: 3264111934402461761
    - rid: 3264111934402461758
    - rid: 3264111934402461790
  - content: After the exam, the technical team tried excavating the remaining crystals
      and discovered that they were actually growing on a meteor fragment.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 3264111934402461763
  - content: The scientists theorize that this fragment originates from one of the
      asteroids that first brought the Waste to Earth and created the Wasteland.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: 'Since you found the nest, refined our battle plan, and took down the
      Queen Beetle, we gave you full credit for this discovery. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "You deserved it Jackie, I\u2019m proud. And I\u2019m sure your mom
      would be just as proud if she were here, knowing you were capable of beating
      her old record."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Thanks, Ives. But now that I can go on these Wasteland expeditions,
      I\u2019ll tell Mama myself!"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 3264111934402461764
  - content: Haha of course, but you might want to brush up on that stealth of yours
      first.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 3264111934402461788
  - content: "Seeing as you\u2019ve broken several expedition records, maybe evading
      all this newfound attention would be good practice."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 3264111934402461789
  - content: Word has begun to spread after all.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Ives winks at Jackie. She spreads her arms out.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "C\u2019mere, Jackie. Welcome to the NITES."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4fef3aeb65460fd498ab9efe9bac8625, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 3264111934402461786
    - rid: 3264111934402461787
